# Overwrite backups. Each entry is a verbatim copy of a run artifact -- the
# copy that restored a 47KB task-manifest.md during this tool's own testing.
# Useful on disk, never in history: committing them would duplicate every
# contract document once per save.
.backups/

# Atomic-write temp files. writeAtomic() unlinks these on failure, so one
# surviving here means the process died mid-write.
.*.tmp
